	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030270"},
		line=1440,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Word of Elsa's mutiny apparently hasn't reached the rank and file yet, and we're waved into the Republican occupation with little more than a greeting.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We march through the checkpoint in an orderly formation to avoid raising any suspicions.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"It's a good thing they haven't been put on alert, as our force only numbers around a hundred strong.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"We'd stand no chance in a frontal assault.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you know the lay of the security arrangements at the Government-General?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I've delivered flowers there plenty of times.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Figures. Not quite your average florist, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
{"font", size=49},
"The Republican General Government Building, commonly known as the Government-General, is located in a complex running 2300 meters north to south and 1500 meters east to west.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"To call it heavily guarded would be an understatement; there are over 10,000 troops stationed on the premises, and a further 10,000 on standby at nearby garrisons.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The Republicans also boast overwhelming firepower, as evidenced by the veritable columns of tanks and armored vehicles that can be seen even from the outside.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Rather than a seat of government, it'd be more accurate to call it a fortress.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Warren will likely be in his office located near the center of the complex, about ten minutes by foot from the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If fighting breaks out before we make it into the Government-General itself, we won't stand a single chance.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are we going in through the front gate, just like with the checkpoint?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Elsa answers me with a wide grin.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"If they get even the least bit suspicious, it's all over for us─",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"She must have nerves of steel to still be able to smile at a time like this.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's do this.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Taking the lead, Elsa marches us straight towards the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Two armored vehicles and over a dozen guards stand in our path at the front gates.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Follow me. Just act natural.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Elsa leads us right up to the front gates.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"The guards all raise a salute as soon as they spot her.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“At ease, men.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'll be borrowing three of these trucks. Mind starting the engines for us?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Elsa gestures towards a column of armored personnel transports parked on the premises.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The guards leap to it at once.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I clamber into the back of one of the trucks along with Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"It's fully covered, preventing anyone outside from being able to see us.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Just what we need.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"The trucks set off with a deep roar of their engines.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"All the soldiers around me silently begin their final equipment checks.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Elsa unholsters her radio and issues her orders in a cool, crisp voice.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Pull up as close as you can in front of the command center.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Deploy into fire teams Alpha through Echo and secure breaching points ASAP.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You're cleared to engage, but do your best to minimize casualties. Over.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Elsa ends her transmission and returns to inspecting her equipment in silence.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Each of her movements is smooth and well-practiced.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Is this really that interesting?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Never seen anything like it before.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though I never thought I'd ever end up fighting alongside the Republican Army in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We aren't the Republican Army anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"─We're the “Elsa Valentine Army” now!",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"One of the soldiers calls out, and the truck rings out with laughter.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"This camaraderie among soldiers is a comfortable thing indeed, no matter their nationality.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The vehicle finally pulls to a stop.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I leap out and immediately survey the surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"We've made it all the way to the courtyard of the command center, less than a minute's dash away.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Here we go.)”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"As soon as Elsa gives the signal, her soldiers split up into five separate elements and approach the building with perfectly drilled movements.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Elsa's personal unit is known even among the warriors for their consummate professionalism.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Every soldier knows his precise role and carries it out perfectly, allowing the unit to move like a single living organism.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"It's a completely different way of fighting from the warriors, who emphasize independent judgment and freedom of action.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Elsa and I stealthily creep up towards the building's main entrance.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Your men are a sight to behold.)”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(They're the best of the best.)”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(We've trained together ever since we were stationed here.)”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Our friendlies sneak up behind the two sentries standing watch at the main entrance.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"They simultaneously incapacitate both soldiers with surgical movements and swiftly drag their bodies into the shadows.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"An identical scene is likely unfolding at each of the other entrances as well.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Breach and enter is a go.)”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Tokita-kun, feel free to show us what you've got as well.)”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I'll do everything I can.)”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Elsa and I take up positions right outside the building's main entrance.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Let's do this.)”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Elsa gives the radio on her chest two quick taps.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"The doors are immediately blown wide off their hinges.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Several flash grenades sail in through the open entrance.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"We charge straight through the cloud of white smoke they let off.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I instantly cut down the two dazed and blinded soldiers standing guard at the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haaaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I turn to face the incoming fire, swinging my blade down with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The resulting shockwave cascades down the narrow hallway, and the soldiers lurking at the end scream as they duck for cover.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Elsa rattles off several shots in quick succession.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Every shot finds its mark, their victims dropping their weapons or crumpling to the ground depending on whether they were hit in the arms or legs.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Even in such a chaotic battle, she's intentionally shooting not to kill.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"That's some truly extraordinary ability.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Suddenly, an enemy soldier leaps out from the shadows and takes aim at us.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I immediately tackle Elsa to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"A sharp sound whizzes past my ears, and my hair dances on the wind.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kh!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Elsa draws a bead on him before she even hits the ground.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The single shot she fires immediately incapacitates the soldier who just fired at us.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Phew... That was close.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks for saving me.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're comrades now. No need to thank me.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I pick myself up and offer her my hand.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Grasping it firmly, Elsa pulls herself upright.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Comrades, you say?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you don't feel the same way, then so be it.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Elsa turns my way and coolly chambers a new round.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Elsa?!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"She squeezes the trigger before I can get another word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I whirl around to find a newly-arrived soldier clutching his leg on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That enough proof of my feelings for you?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Elsa flashes me a smile worth a thousand gold coins.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“C'mon, we're still a long ways away.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"The garrison seems confused by the assault from soldiers wearing their own uniform and isn't mounting any effective resistance.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Not to mention the fact that the intruders are Elsa\nValentine's personal unit, the most crack troops the Republican Army has to offer.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I can easily imagine how overwhelmed they must feel.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Surrender, and your lives will be spared! Throw down your weapons immediately!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Resist, and we will show no mercy!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Elsa invites the defenders to surrender as we push into each new sector.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Every time she does, almost all the enemy soldiers lay down their arms.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Without warning, a low-flying screech rattles the windows of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Attack aircraft!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Several seconds later, a dull reverberation runs through the foundations of the building.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"The telltale sound of bombs finding their mark.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's coming from the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He's bombing the Imperial Palace? He isn't giving a damn about public sentiment anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Warren might be trying to take this opportunity to annex the Empire wholesale.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's take him down. Quickly.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right, let's pick up the pace. He's on the second floor.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Elsa and I race up the stairs to the governor-general's office.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"The halls leading up his office are a war zone.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Unlike the enemies on the first floor, the defenders here seem entirely unwilling to surrender.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't think we'll get any further if we only aim to incapacitate and not kill.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're wasting time. We need to end this now.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Right.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Up until now, Elsa has been doing everything she could to avoid taking the lives of the defending soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Though we're fighting against them now, they were once her trusted allies.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Many of her friends and acquaintances are likely among their ranks.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Give me just one more chance to try and talk them down!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Make it quick.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Elsa points the grip of her handgun towards me.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hold on to this for me.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're going to go unarmed?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Elsa nods in response.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'd go that far just to spare their lives?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's no reason we have to fight each other in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Once she hands me her gun, she calls out around the corner to the defenders entrenched at the end of the hall.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm about to step out!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm unarmed! All I'm looking to do is talk!”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I prepare myself to leap out at a moment's notice.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"It'll be too late if I wait until Elsa gets shot.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Her hands raised high above her head, Elsa slowly steps out from behind cover.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"For now, the enemy holds their fire.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Warren has been indiscriminately targeting civilians with his bombings!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even if we are at war, such atrocity is absolutely unforgivable!”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And so, I am acting on behalf of my conscience to bring him to justice.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think, brothers and sisters! Why did you make the choice to enlist in the Republican Army?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Did you do it in order to slaughter innocents?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course not!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You enlisted to liberate the people of the world from tyranny!”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Never did you imagine that you would be massacring the defenseless and the unarmed! Am I wrong?!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All of you already know what you must do!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It is not to continue defending a superior officer who orders the indiscriminate bombing of civilians!”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Cease your resistance immediately and submit yourself to my command!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Under me, the Republican Army shall be reborn!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Please, remember what you are truly fighting to protect!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"The enemy soldiers offer no reaction.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Either they're ignoring Elsa, or they're seriously considering her words.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I clutch my spellblade tight, ready to leap into action at the first sign of hostility.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Until─",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"A single enemy soldier steps out from behind cover.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"He instantly folds his hands behind his head to signal that he is unarmed.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I thank you for showing the moral courage to surrender.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And what of the rest of you? Who else will follow his lead?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Elsa's rousing appeal stirs the remaining defenders to begin surrendering in droves.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've done the right thing. Rest assured that you will come to no harm.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"The relief is evident on every last soldier's face.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"It goes without saying that they abhorred the thought of having to kill their fellow Republicans.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looks like you reached them with your words.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I slide in next to Elsa and commend her efforts.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm just glad to have avoided needless bloodshed.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I guess they ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"would",
{"/font"},
" be outraged at Warren for bombing his own troops.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does Warren have a reputation for indiscriminately bombing innocents?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ever since I enlisted, I've done everything I can to put a stop to it, but before that, he used to do it all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I think back to what Shino once told me.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"At the behest of his corporate buddies, Warren would often conduct unwarranted bombings merely for the purpose of testing weapons and expending munitions.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"This was how he earned his vast fortunes from the arms industry.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But in the end, he never gave a damn about a single word I said.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Turns out he's the sort of person who wouldn't even call off the bombing despite knowing his own daughter was in Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose I was wrong to expect even that much humanity out of him.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Elsa shrugs her shoulders with a helpless smile.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Though she's putting up a brave front, I can tell how much\nshe's hurting inside.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But even knowing that, you still ran to Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your courage is worthy of admiration.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I just wanted to preserve the last bit of virtue I have.\nThere's nothing to admire about that.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I even went and got my own men wrapped up in it.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Elsa turns and shows a self-deprecating smile to her subordinates behind her.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"The Elsa Valentine Army has almost doubled in size at this point, and all of its members look up at their leader with trust in their eyes.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We're in the home stretch now. Time to bring Warren to justice.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Steeling herself, Elsa heads straight for the\ngovernor-general's office.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"She shoots out the lock before kicking the door open herself.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Warren Valentine directs us an unperturbed look from his desk.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"There's no one else in the room besides him.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I see you've brought a warrior along with you.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Did you pick him up off the streets of Yogarasu District?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Warren Valentine, surrender at once.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“You think you've won against me?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I hold your life in my hands.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As a soldier, you should understand full well when you're beat.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Elsa's expression is as sharp as flint.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Order all your forces to stand down immediately.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I refuse.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You don't intend to stop, no matter how many civilians you kill?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Don't waste my time with your stupid questions.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If you want to put a stop to the attacks, kill me and issue the orders yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“But you should know the entire army was just issued a directive that anyone who follows you will be charged with desertion.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“This came straight from the mainland.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I sincerely doubt most troops will listen to your orders.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If you're not confident, shall I issue them on your behalf?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Elsa's hand wavers ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you value your life, call off the attacks.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Throw away your gun and apologize, and I'll order a ceasefire.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He's bluffing.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your higher-ups would never issue a directive like that in such a short span of time.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Me or that warrior? You are free to choose whom to believe.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Elsa bites her lip.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"She's unable to arrive at an answer.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...How could you?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How could you bomb civilians without any hesitation?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“You should already know the answer.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All for money and power?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Warren neither confirms nor denies it.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do money and power really taste so sweet?!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Enough that you would willingly murder innocent people for them?!”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“People who ask too many questions will never grow up.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“You can go ahead and carve that on my headstone for me.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Paying no heed to us, Warren calmly opens his desk drawer and pulls out a handgun.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Now then, one of us is going to die here, so who'll it be?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wait─!”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"A gunshot rings out.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"I interpose myself in front of Elsa and swat away the incoming bullet.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, get it together!”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Again and again, Warren pulls the trigger.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"I deflect all the bullets with my spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Why do you take Elsa's side, warrior? Did she not kill your comrades?”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All she did was faithfully carry out her duties.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I care not about her nationality or status. What I believe in is the Elsa Valentine I've come to know!”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"What I believe in is the girl who resolved to find her own fealty, and went as far as to bet her own life on that answer.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Seduced by a stray Imperial mutt, were you?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Warren turns his lips up into a sneer.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"The sharp crack piercing the air does not come from in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"But rather, the smoking gun held in Elsa's firm grip.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Kh...!”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"Warren clutches at his shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Crimson blood drips down from his uniform.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The warriors are proud and loyal hounds, not stray mutts.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Elsa turns her back on Warren and barks orders to the soldiers waiting outside.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Place Warren under arrest.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm issuing an immediate ceasefire order. Prepare a transmission line.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Five minutes after Warren is taken into custody─",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Elsa broadcasts an order to cease all hostilities and the news of Warren's removal from office to all Republican soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"The gunshots coming from the Imperial Palace soon fall silent, and the attack aircraft circling overhead fly back beyond the sea.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Contrary to what Warren said, all Republican forces unquestioningly comply with Elsa's orders.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was a bluff after all.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“His most trusted men already surrendered to me. I knew there was no way it was true.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"She raises a good point.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's impressive how cool-headed you are.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wouldn't have realized if you never said what you did. Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Elsa shows me a gentle smile, all her tension having been lifted.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you send word to the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes. I told them to come meet me at the Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hope they didn't suffer too many casualties from the airstrikes.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"We warriors are defenseless against attacks from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"I just hope everyone made it out alive.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Akari and the rest of the Blades arrive at the Government-General close to an hour later.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you hurt?”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou protected me.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm all right, too.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same here.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"These few words are all we need.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"We silently bask in the warmth of each other's gazes, safe in the knowledge that all of us live to fight another day.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, how did it go for you?”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We successfully secured the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But we weren't able to put down Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He got away?”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Someone beat us to it and killed him before we even got there.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It was a gunshot wound, so we think it was a Republican soldier, though we can't say for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In the end, I wasn't able to avenge my mother's death myself...”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Though her voice conveys her disappointment, Akari's expression isn't downcast.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"She's matured enough to be able to place the future of the Empire before her personal vendetta.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where's Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She's still in the Imperial Palace. Koyuzu and Mutsumi are watching over her.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank goodness nothing happened to her.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Elsa lets out a sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sounds like we owe you big time.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You were the one who put a stop to the Republican Army, right?”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, that's how things turned out in the end.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I should confess now that I always doubted your true intentions.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suspected that you were intending to entrap the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You have my sincere apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh my, you warriors are an awfully distrustful bunch,\naren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Some of us are more justified than others.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Elsa and I share a knowing smile.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"The two of us know full well that we were both deceiving the other.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"And so, this is our way of showing that we forgive each other.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's this going on between you two?”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just our little secret.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyways, what do you intend to do next, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Your Highness?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That all depends on you, Madam Soon-to-Be Governor-General.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That hasn't been decided yet.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And what'll you do when it is?”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right now, you have the entire Republican Army at your fingertips.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you felt like it, you could wipe out the Sworn Blades before the sun comes up.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"Akari's face is deadly serious.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"Depending on how Elsa answers, the conflict between the Sworn Blades and the Republic could continue on.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"No matter how trustworthy Elsa's proven herself to be, we would become enemies once again.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I think you have the wrong idea.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't see the warriors as my enemy anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's a lot I could say about the past, but still, you're the only reason we didn't die in the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think of you as my enemy either.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You know, Tokita-kun is the only reason that I'm still alive.”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa is a comrade in arms. I trust her with my life.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"All of us look towards Hotori for her answer.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm still not sure myself.”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I'll put my faith in Miyaguni and Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you, Inou-san.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Honestly, I think I'm going to have my hands full trying to bring the army to heel for quite some time.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As I said, it's also not a done deal that I'll get to be the next governor-general, and I'll probably have to go back to the mainland to testify to what happened.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's far too soon for me to speak of the Empire's future.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"Elsa tells us all this with a stern expression.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"But a faint smile soon crosses her lips.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But I will say this.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My ideal is for the Empire to become a democracy.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll do everything in my power to build a peaceful and egalitarian society.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I sincerely hope that you'll agree to work alongside me.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"For the past three years, the warriors and Elsa have accumulated a river's worth of bad blood between us.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"I won't deny that.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"But even so, I want to let bygones be bygones and put my faith in her.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"I remember Elsa once told me that even the purest of souls would soon get sullied by the muck of reality.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"That on the battlefield, no spirit is noble enough to block bullets, no ideal is lofty enough to defeat the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"In spite of all that, though, Elsa still crawled around in that muck, staking her own life on her fealty.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"That's why I have but one word to describe this radiant girl standing before me, this girl braver than any warrior I've ever known─",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"She's beautiful.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
